From: Justus <justadeayo@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2026 13:49:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] kernel: build: migrate to unity build

---
 kernel/Kconfig           |  27 ++
 kernel/Makefile          | 130 +++++++++
 kernel/kernel_includes.h | 569 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 kernel/ksu.c             |  82 ++++++
 4 files changed, 808 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 kernel/Kconfig
